      "updated": 1786525798929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This document outlines the end-to-end technical execution flow, data flow, and runtime mechanics of the Virtual CFO Agentic AI assistant. It\nexplains how user queries are routed, how Gemini dynamically calls accounting APIs, and catalog-level details of all 16 integration tools.",
